  "laws": [
    "focus is not the total case",
    "practice may change posture without rewriting external facts",
    "attempt != delivery_reported != receipt_confirmed != outcome_observed",
    "interruption preserves a return address",
    "same meters != same lived path",
    "scarcity is real: a choice may make another lawful choice temporarily unavailable",
    "opportunity cost must remain inspectable",
    "culture trace != human worth",
    "wildcard may alter declared grammar but may not silently alter provenance",
    "dice choose proposals; witnessed reality determines the record",
    "the player inhabits the choice; Dogram calculates declared mechanics"
  ]
